{"posts":[{"id":"amit_p2_26","t":"I hope this is last consumption of buys.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#26","p":2,"im":["4fcf2d8bbc38ba6f63cdc0bf6c26a2d928518859"],"m":26},{"id":"amit_p2_27","t":"Bit late..","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#27","p":2,"im":["c66952c8e09f26876a2b038ef6035ce59bcf0df3"],"m":27},{"id":"amit_p2_28","t":"Let's see why price dropped there\n\n-A high liquidity drop decision.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#28","p":2,"im":["2f1c21c625a310e4d6a35b4ef433c15e1ad180bc","2b439b4f19b131ddd0200c417898af5e4f7925cc"],"m":28},{"id":"amit_p2_29","t":"Finding reasons to drop.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#29","p":2,"im":["950372618659b581acb9ade65099d28e7ca5f2d7"],"m":29},{"id":"amit_p2_30","t":"milkeyway wrote: Finding reasons to drop.\n\nI marked that FTR on my chart couldn't trade it cos it happened during london, I live in the States and don't like limit orders. good spotting Amit","a":"oliverpip","d":"","n":"#30","p":2,"im":["950372618659b581acb9ade65099d28e7ca5f2d7"],"m":30},{"id":"amit_p2_31","t":"finding the reason to drop.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#31","p":2,"im":["2ecf9e80800b948d78ee63a831796d23f2c9abf2","991c5f5d5cdc53e56f831bbfc9aa9bf1835d8f63"],"m":31},{"id":"amit_p2_32","t":"Yes it reacted because it has a beautiful FTR at the left side.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#32","p":2,"im":["1b472edc5ec0df968cedd285f16aacd1b3731f6c","c23d76d09aec2d4b5b8c60694b2eb6af432ee777"],"m":32},{"id":"amit_p2_33","t":"","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#33","p":2,"im":["dd8ce12ee57826565c5e947be46bed571ba8140c"],"m":33},{"id":"amit_p2_34","t":"","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#34","p":2,"im":["ba2aacca2e2a3a8c026d49548f2231b60a345897"],"m":34},{"id":"amit_p2_35","t":"","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#35","p":2,"im":["293ed1dfaf28f3db98721833de9da144a7311319"],"m":35},{"id":"amit_p2_36","t":"","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#36","p":2,"im":["3062c51eb077d4f7cd6b68a2de914f1ea9b665f0"],"m":36},{"id":"amit_p2_37","t":"Hits the box perfectly.\n\nmilkeyway wrote:","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#37","p":2,"im":["37dbf04a5ed380579dd520c3fa1752b78b09008a"],"m":37},{"id":"amit_p2_38","t":"Really nice work today Amit! Great patience and excellent entries!\n\nNew avatar too it looks like - I'm assuming that's a pic of you?","a":"polymorph","d":"","n":"#38","p":2,"im":[],"m":38},{"id":"amit_p2_39","t":"polymorph wrote: Really nice work today Amit! Great patience and excellent entries!\n\nNew avatar too it looks like - I'm assuming that's a pic of you?\n\nYes. It's me.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#39","p":2,"im":[],"m":39},{"id":"amit_p2_40","t":"Cool, it's good to see the \"face behind the trades\":)","a":"polymorph","d":"","n":"#40","p":2,"im":[],"m":40},{"id":"amit_p2_41","t":"Nice trades Amit! All your hard work and perseverance now paying you back","a":"DrSwing","d":"","n":"#41","p":2,"im":[],"m":41},{"id":"amit_p2_42","t":"polymorph wrote: Cool, it's good to see the \"face behind the trades\":)\n\nDrSwing wrote: Nice trades Amit! All your hard work and perseverance now paying you back\n\nThanks Dr Swing & Poly","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#42","p":2,"im":[],"m":42},{"id":"amit_p2_43","t":"Just had 2 days holidays. Came back to the PC. There was a pending order placed before holidays. Trade is going on well and SL moved to BE.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#43","p":2,"im":["72442a5e1d0cb08559c0713aa17b28004d98aa58"],"m":43},{"id":"amit_p2_44","t":"Missed","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#44","p":2,"im":["1a3812a322cc0e6b522f55c43ab917531ed81b7f"],"m":44},{"id":"amit_p2_45","t":"milkeyway wrote: Just had 2 days holidays. Came back to the PC. There was a pending order placed before holidays. Trade is going on well and SL moved to BE.\n\nAbout the trade. Please comments and suggestions. Thanks.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#45","p":2,"im":["c1cac07b1624c78ed0c68eacd4ccf54c19078e9e"],"m":45},{"id":"amit_p2_46","t":"Hey Amit. Nice catch.\n\nJust my two cents: I think your SL is at risk to be taken as it is located right on a QM level. Something I had deal a lot before was I realized once I am in a trade I thnk capital and forget PA. I got stopped out so many times before on break Even because of that. so my advice to you: keep thinking PA although you are in a position. The market does not care about your capital, only PA matters.","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#46","p":2,"im":[],"m":46},{"id":"amit_p2_47","t":"benhur wrote: Hey Amit. Nice catch.\n\nJust my two cents: I think your SL is at risk to be taken as it is located right on a QM level. Something I had deal a lot before was I realized once I am in a trade I thnk capital and forget PA. I got stopped out so many times before on break Even because of that. so my advice to you: keep thinking PA although you are in a position. The market does not care about your capital, only PA matters.\n\nThanks Behhur. My SL was there because when price broke the RS, it created an FTR and then price dropped and engulfed the FTR and while engulfing it failed to go up. So, above those spike my SL was there. Any ways I have moved it as per your suggestion. Thanks.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#47","p":2,"im":[],"m":47},{"id":"amit_p2_48","t":"I have hope for 3751.","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#48","p":2,"im":["750aff584a7eb078bb4359949d80be9ae1056fe0"],"m":48},{"id":"amit_p2_49","t":"","a":"milkeyway","d":"","n":"#49","p":2,"im":["5e4a4c925f3dcb1b2b45cc2d133e6d219c963920"],"m":49},{"id":"amit_p2_50","t":"Good spotting Amit, will keep an eye on this pair. Enjoy your weekend!","a":"oliverpip","d":"","n":"#50","p":2,"im":[],"m":50}],"images":[{"k":"4fcf2d8bbc38ba6f63cdc0bf6c26a2d928518859","t":"assets/thumbs/4fcf2d8bbc38ba6f63cdc0bf6c26a2d928518859.webp","f":"assets/images/4fcf2d8bbc38ba6f63cdc0bf6c26a2d928518859.png","w":1020,"h":624,"b":21102,"o":"4fcf2d8bbc38ba6f63cdc0bf6c26a2d928518859.png","p":2,"pid":"amit_p2_26"},{"k":"c66952c8e09f26876a2b038ef6035ce59bcf0df3","t":"assets/thumbs/c66952c8e09f26876a2b038ef6035ce59bcf0df3.webp","f":"assets/images/c66952c8e09f26876a2b038ef6035ce59bcf